          <h2 class="section-title">Defence-in-depth for modern networks</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's network security practice addresses the reality that modern networks extend beyond traditional perimeters — to cloud environments, remote users, branch offices, and partner connections. We design layered security architectures that enforce policy at every network boundary, from the internet edge to internal segment-to-segment traffic.</p>
          <p>Our zero-trust approach assumes no implicit trust based on network location. Every connection is authenticated, every device is verified, and every data flow is inspected. We deploy next-generation firewalls with application-aware policies, implement micro-segmentation to limit lateral movement, and integrate secure SD-WAN to protect traffic across distributed sites.</p>
